{"pin":"BH00093","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00093","anchor":"","first_line":"O Beloved of my heart and Thou Who art remembered in my soul! The breezes of love that wafted from the gardens [3.5s]... ...Thou hast asked about affection and reconciliation, in the case of Mirza .... This matter was mentioned in the Holy Presence. This is what the tongue of our All-Merciful Lord uttered in response… My blessings, my salutations, and my greetings to the Stars of the heaven of Thy proof and the Hands of Thy Cause","first_line_orig":"یا محبوب فوادی و المذکور فی قلبی قد سرتنی نسمات الحب التی سرت من حدائق... اصلّی و اسلّم و اکبّر علی انجم سمآء عرفانک  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"4610","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA08:461","source":"INBA08","locator":"461","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v008/?page=463"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA22:175","source":"INBA22","locator":"175","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v022/?page=89"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA27:364","source":"INBA27","locator":"364","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba-v027/?page=183"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ANDA#74 p.04x","source":"ANDA","locator":"74 p.04x","url":"https://www.afnanlibrary.org/d/andalib-issue-74"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK3.010.08x","source":"AVK3","locator":"010.08x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK3/ak3-14.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AYI2.235x","source":"AYI2","locator":"235x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/AI2/ai2-221.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DA#176","source":"BRL_DA","locator":"176","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/875520348"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MYD.011-012x","source":"MYD","locator":"011-012x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/390.pdf#page=17"},{"kind":"publication","code":"PYK.073","source":"PYK","locator":"073","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/1484.pdf#page=90"},{"kind":"translation","code":"ADMS#137x","source":"ADMS","locator":"137x","url":"https://adibma